  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Humanitarian Deployable Power Restoration Teams &#x2013; Pacific</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This investment funds a standby emergency humanitarian deployable capability and cache of technical equipment to ensure the prompt and safe return of on-grid power supply following disasters in the Pacific region. The investment includes contractual arrangements with two Australian power companies (providing deployable personnel and technical expertise) as well as with the Humanitarian Logistics Capability (for the procurement, storage and maintenance of a cache of technical equipment).</narrative>
  </description>
